<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Kalgold in profit in Dec qtr, output jumps.</title>
<headline>Kalgold in profit in Dec qtr, output jumps.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-December versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Net profit before capital spending 0.05 vs 7.36 loss</p>
<p>    Capital spending			 3.96 vs 4.28</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled			 208,000 vs 137,000</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)			137.2 vs 37.1</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)			   0.66 vs 0.27</p>
<p>    Cost (rand/kg)			 96,064 vs 258,032</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)		    55,940 vs 55,795</p>
<p>Full name: Kalahari Goldridge Mining Co Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Newly-listed Kalgold said results reflected costs associated with start-up and commissioning, but added that the build up of plant throughput had been disappointing.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
